1465	  /// instructions are updated to match the layout. Pass \p FixBranches set to
1466	  /// false if the branches are known to be up to date with the code layout.
1467	  ///
1468	  /// Return the pair where the first size is for the main part, and the second
1469	  /// size is for the cold one.
1470	  /// Modify BinaryBasicBlock::OutputAddressRange for each basic block in the
1471	  /// function in place so that BinaryBasicBlock::getOutputSize() gives the
